The "spirit of NetHack" does not include bad puns. (It does include
good puns, though.)

In response to the issue of cyanide capsules, my reasoning for
assigning them this behaviour is as follows:

1) One of the pills must be poisonous.
2) Cyanide capsules are the most popular variety of poison pill.
3) Cyanide capsules, to my albeit scant knowledge, are always lethal.
This is a major characteristic of them. For them to be otherwise would
be to disrespect the source material.

Also in defense:
* Three roles and one race have poison resistance by level 3, so the
criterion to survive the cyanide capsule is not nearly unknown at low
levels.
* One cannot be blamed for expecting the player to exercise a level of
prudence when dealing with something as hazardous as drug capsules.



